{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >flowloop&amp; is a minimalistic anti-gravity racer where you try and stay on the track for as long as you can. Every day you can play on three new procedurally generated levels where you race around in 3D-space. The game is intended for those moments where you have a short 5 - 20 min break and just want to get your mind off whatever you are currently doing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard controls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn with A-D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost with \u2191 decelerate with \u2193</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad controls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn with left stick</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost with X decelerate\u00a0with\u00a0A</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls can\u00a0be\u00a0found and changed in\u00a0the\u00a0Settings\u00a0menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strafing and\u00a0sharp\u00a0turns\u00a0to help\u00a0you\u00a0stay\u00a0on the track\u00a0longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works\u00a0with\u00a0a\u00a0controller\u00a0and\u00a0keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the\u00a0game stutters\u00a0then\u00a0please\u00a0consider\u00a0turning\u00a0down the\u00a0AA\u00a0and\u00a0track details.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763110?t=1749572149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763110?t=1749572149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763110/01266e111dc249dc1a9a2e251f1750b27386e0e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749572149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763110/01266e111dc249dc1a9a2e251f1750b27386e0e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749572149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_d